  "title": "Quinoa and Pepper Pilaf",
  "description": "Protein-packed quinoa is toasted, then cooked until tender with sweet peppers and garlic for a hearty side dish. You can serve this wholesome grain dish hot, at room temperature, or even chilled. It’s perfect for any season!",
